The code assumes that the structures being populated have a `RX_UE_INFORMATION_TAG` member of type `uint32_t`, a `RNTI` member of type `uint16_t`, and a `CRCFLAG` member of type `bool`. The function also assumes that the array will be used to store structures with unique combinations of these two members.']

