The solution is scalable as it uses a circular buffer, making it efficient in handling increasing numbers of channel configurations while maintaining optimal performance. The code does not lock the entire data structure when querying its current state, allowing multiple threads to access the channels concurrently without contention. Lastly, error handling is included to manage failures in external configuration service requests and ensure stability and recovery from transient errors.']

