The validation function checks for unique tags and valid CRCFLAG values, handling edge cases such as malformed data or unexpected input sizes gracefully by limiting the array size to `MAX_ELEMENTS`. This ensures scalability and maintainability while still integrating seamlessly with an existing network stack.']

